.TH ORBITAL 2
.SH NAME
orbital \- live multi-body orbital-model interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B include "danby/orbital.m";
.SH DESCRIPTION
An orbital model supplies body masses, initial states, equations, controls, and
two diagnostics.  The shared client integrates all bodies, retains persistent
colour-coded trails, scales the orbital view, labels bodies, and plots both
diagnostics against time.
.SH SOURCE
.B /module/danby/orbital.m
.br
.B /appl/temple/orbital.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR gravity (2),
.IR plot (2)
